  "text.config.deeperdarker.option.server.sculkLeechesFromAncientVaseChance.tooltip": "Defines the chance of Sculk Leeches spawning\nfrom an Ancient Vase if the setting above ends up\nbeing true. If a mob should spawn and this\nsetting ends up being false, a Stalker will spawn.",
